<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's net forex reserves fall in March.</title>
<headline>Portugal's net forex reserves fall in March.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal's net foreign exchange reserves, including gold valued at market prices, fell $508 million to $20.123 billion in March, the central bank said in its latest monthly review of the economy.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>				    March 97	 Jan-March 97</p>
<p>Change in reserves	     -508	     -141</p>
<p>Total net forex reserves     20,123	     -</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
